  "limitations": [
    "The deployed Groth16 verification key was produced for a Testnet development release with one Kletia contribution. It is not a production multiparty trusted setup and must never be promoted to Mainnet.",
    "A matching WASM hash proves the deployed bytecode did not change; it does not prove the bytecode is safe, audited or economically correct.",
    "Stellar Testnet is periodically reset. After a reset every contract identity and observed hash must be re-verified before any release claim is renewed.",
    "An unpinned contract is reported as observed_unpinned. Kletia does not present an unpinned observation as a verified pin."
